  "notes": "An ichidan verb. Frequently encountered in historical narratives and period dramas. The particle ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ marks the person being served. In modern usage, this word has a somewhat formal or literary flavor compared to the more neutral ⟦{働|はたら}く→働く：00503_hataraku⟧ (to work).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{神|かみ}→神：02147_kami⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{仕|つか}える (serve God)\n- ⟦{主君|しゅくん}→主君：11712_shukun⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{仕|つか}える (serve one's lord)\n- ⟦{国|くに}→国：02204_kuni⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{仕|つか}える (serve one's country)\n- ⟦{宮廷|きゅうてい}→宮廷：12526_kyuutei⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{仕|つか}える (serve at court)",
